# Terraform / OpenTofu working state. `tofu init` downloads provider binaries that are hundreds of
# megabytes; committing one is an instant pre-receive rejection (GitHub's limit is 100 MB/file).
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
plan.tfplan
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# --- terraform ---
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
tfplan
# .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed: it pins provider versions + checksums.
